# Workflow

- Write only in `balance-bites-ops`. Treat `costs/` and `saved data` as read-only unless the user says otherwise.
- Git remote stays `https://github.com/Jovo-Jovi/balance-bites-ops`. No Cursor Origin. Commit/push only when asked. PowerShell: `;` not `&&`.
- Slice order: hub (done) → invoices (done) → design (done) → finance (done on `main`) → weekly status (`docs/STATUS.md`; upgrade on `feat/reports-module`). Do not start another app unless asked.
- One HTTPS hub, four cards after login. No KPIs on `/`.
- Same `bb_*` keys. CloudStore hydrates from Firestore; never write empty defaults when a key is missing.
- Writer map is in `docs/DATA.md` and `hub/src/lib/bb-keys.json`. Do not invert it. Invoice catalog is read-only. Finance writes returns. Design writes templates + `label_assets/` on R2 (not Firebase Storage). Spark only.
- Do not run `import:apply` or `import:assets` unless asked (zip `saved data` first).
- After a slice, update `docs/PARITY.md` and `docs/JOURNAL.md`. Tick only what is in production behavior.

# Parity

Grep live HTML before inventing a screen. If it exists in `costs/`, port it or list it as an explicit gap — never silently drop it. Do not copy bugs from `costs/report.md`; copy intended formulas.
